      "pinyin": "yí wèi chū zū chē sī jī bǎ chē tíng zài lù biān xiǎng shuì yí huì'r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他刚一躺下，就有人问他时间。他看看表说：“快到12点了。”",
      "traditional": "他剛一躺下，就有人問他時間。他看看錶說：“快到12點了。”",
      "pinyin": "tā gāng yì tǎng xià jiù yǒu rén wèn tā shí jiān tā kàn kan biǎo shuō kuài dào 2 diǎn le",
      "english": "A taxi driver parked by the side of the road to sleep for a while."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "As soon as he lay down, someone asked him what time it was. He looked at his watch and said, “Almost 12 o’clock.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "他再次躺下，刚睡着，又有人敲窗户问：",
      "traditional": "他再次躺下，剛睡著，又有人敲窗戶問：",
      "pinyin": "tā zài cì tǎng xià gāng shuì zháo yòu yǒu rén qiāo chuāng hu wèn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "“先生，您知道时间吗？”他只好再次看表，回答道：“12点半了。”",
      "traditional": "“先生，您知道時間嗎？”他只好再次看錶，回答道：“12點半了。”",
      "pinyin": "xiān sheng nín zhī dào shí jiān ma tā zhǐ hǎo zài cì kàn biǎo huí dá dào 2 diǎn bàn le",
      "english": "He lay down once more. Just as he had fallen asleep, someone else knocked on the window and asked, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ".. “Mister, do you know what time it is?” He had to look at his watch again, and answer, “Half past 12.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "但敲窗户的人太多了，他根本没办法睡觉。",
      "traditional": "但敲窗戶的人太多了，他根本沒辦法睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "dàn qiāo chuāng hu de rén tài duō le tā gēn běn méi bàn fǎ shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "于是，他就写了个纸条贴在车窗上：我不知道时间，我很困。",
      "traditional": "於是，他就寫了個紙條貼在車窗上：我不知道時間，我很睏。",
      "pinyin": "yú shì tā jiù xiě le ge zhǐ tiáo tiē zài chē chuāng shang wǒ bù zhī dào shí jiān wǒ hěn kùn",
      "english": "But too many people were knocking on his window and there was no way at all for him to fall asleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Thereupon, he wrote a note and stuck it on the car window: I don’t know the time, I’m very tired."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "司机再次躺下，但几分钟后又有一个人边敲窗户边大声说：",
      "traditional": "司機再次躺下，但幾分鐘後又有一個人邊敲窗戶邊大聲說：",
      "pinyin": "sī jī zài cì tǎng xià dàn jǐ fēn zhōng hòu yòu yǒu yí ge rén biān qiāo chuāng hu biān dà shēng shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "“喂！先生！现在下午一点差一刻啦！”",
      "traditional": "“喂！先生！現在下午一點差一刻啦！”",
      "pinyin": "wéi xiān sheng xiàn zài xià wǔ yī diǎn chà yí kè la",
      "english": "The driver lay down once more, but a few minutes later yet another person knocked on the window and said loudly, .."
    }
