    "sentence_translations": [
      "I Don’t Know the Time",
      "",
      "A taxi driver parked by the side of the road to sleep for a while.",
      "As soon as he lay down, someone asked him what time it was. He looked at his watch and said, “Almost 12 o’clock.”",
      "",
      "He lay down once more. Just as he had fallen asleep, someone else knocked on the window and asked, ..",
      ".. “Mister, do you know what time it is?” He had to look at his watch again, and answer, “Half past 12.”",
      "",
      "But too many people were knocking on his window and there was no way at all for him to fall asleep.",
      "Thereupon, he wrote a note and stuck it on the car window: I don’t know the time, I’m very tired.",
      "",
      "The driver lay down once more, but a few minutes later yet another person knocked on the window and said loudly, ..",
      ".. “Hey! Mister! Right now it’s a quarter to one in the afternoon!”"
    ]
